abstract: "HAGRID is a notebook-based Python framework for modelling residential local energy systems. It combines behaviour-driven electricity-demand reconstruction from time-use information, household-level electricity profiling, additional electrified loads, and local energy system operational optimization with simplified low-voltage network constraints."
